@page "/purchase/self-billed-debit-notes"
@inherits PageBase

@*
    Why this thin page exists — do NOT fold this route back into `PoSbCdnList.razor`:

    The self-billed credit-note and debit-note lists are the SAME screen, but they must be served by two
    DIFFERENT page types. Neither URL carries a route parameter, so when the menu navigates client-side
    from /purchase/self-billed-credit-notes to /purchase/self-billed-debit-notes the router resolves the
    same component type and REUSES the existing instance — `OnInitialized` never runs again, so the
    title, the per-family menu rights, the e-Invoice toolbar and the grid stayed on the family the
    operator arrived on, and only a full page load (which builds a new instance) corrected it.

    With two page types the router disposes the old page and creates the new one, so the screen is
    always rebuilt for the URL that is actually showing. `PoSbCdnList` itself resolves the family from
    the URL (`ResolveFamily()`), so it renders correctly when hosted here.

    The same pattern is used for the purchase pair (`PoCdnDebitList`) and the sales pair
    (`SaCdnDebitList`).
*@

